omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UVm7McLXX1UQ7kNvwEY8pB1&_nc_oc=AdoTaMOywNGiXq4aJKtZr6A-ycQrmvHfpYjx321QcudhCVvkvAW2Lq39qgIfMZFCklo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af55fVdo4E6WRWSF3WbHFEmLBGgNyBSfOLG-F-xYBVH2JA&oe=6A1DA3B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ut08Rx0nqD4Q7kNvwGqv7-J&_nc_oc=Adq-BlfPzzQv8afgMLKAnOT89Cb4QZwYdQzldXaIqG_BZbD3R74qXmIXFabf0F7B07Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5URx1flXHF_rNFdtLrHsK6QkLpDrG1yfc7Sf10gsGt2Q&oe=6A1DA516"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_YSt2KVpjbwQ7kNvwG9Escu&_nc_oc=AdrnGVp0USFQXUIBdySez1fGmvT4bnHDv9Ot4pXasW5Ot-5jZECZbBWUPe1xrTXiB6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7OJirWI1K5QjwWekPNqklfY6szjgJDh3x0_DTC7hBoiA&oe=6A1D81F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://